included in this repository or represented as Apache-licensed.

Algorithm reference: F. Jacobs, E. Sundermann, B. De Sutter, M. Christiaens
and I. Lemahieu (1998), A Fast Algorithm to Calculate the Exact Radiological
Path through a Pixel or Voxel Space, CIT 6(1), 89–94.

This initial implementation and documentation were prepared with substantial
OpenAI Codex assistance and require the usual scientific and software review.
